<title>UK: S&amp;P withdraws Pioneer Financial, Electronic ratings.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P withdraws Pioneer Financial, Electronic ratings.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's said on Friday it had withdrawn its A2 short-term ratings on commercial paper programs of Pioneer Financial Management, Inc. and Pioneer Electronics B.V., both guaranteed by their parent, Pioneer Electronic Corp. because of the termination of the programmes.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 6176</p>
</text>
